    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Superligaen i tal 2024/25\"\njupyter: superliga\nexecute:\n  echo: false\n---\n\n\n\n<!--\n  Fælles indhold for alle sider under \"Superligaen i tal\".\n  Hver side (tal/index.qmd for den igangværende sæson, tal/<sæson>.qmd for tidligere sæsoner)\n  sætter variablen SAESON i en kodecelle og inkluderer derefter denne fil.\n  Kun tal og grafer, ingen fortolkende tekst.\n-->\n\n\n\n<p class=\"tal-status\">Sæson 2024/25 · afsluttet</p>\n<p class=\"tal-saesoner\">Sæson: <a href=\"index.html\">2026/27</a> · <a href=\"2025-26.html\">2025/26</a> · <strong>2024/25</strong> · <a href=\"2023-24.html\">2023/24</a> · <a href=\"2022-23.html\">2022/23</a> · <a href=\"2021-22.html\">2021/22</a> · <a href=\"2020-21.html\">2020/21</a></p>\n\n\n## Game states\n\n::: {.column-margin}\n**Game states:** Hvor stor en del af de 90 minutter holdet har været foran, uafgjort og bagud. Mål i tillægstid tæller på periodens sidste minut. Se [metoden](../metode.qmd).\n:::\n\n::: {.column-page-right}\n<picture class=\"graf\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"figurer/2024-25-gamestates-mobil.svg\"><img src=\"figurer/2024-25-gamestates.svg\" alt=\"Andel af spilletiden foran, uafgjort og bagud for hvert hold, Superligaen 2024/25.\" class=\"img-fluid\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture>\n:::\n\n\n## Den alternative tabel\n\n::: {.column-margin}\n**Den alternative tabel:** Placering, hvis alle kampe var stoppet efter 15, 30, 45, 60 eller 75 minutter, og den rigtige placering (90'). Ved stop sorteres efter point; ved 90' også efter målforskel og scorede mål. Hold musen over et tal for at se point.\n:::\n\n<div class=\"tabel-rul\"><table class=\"alt-tabel\"><thead><tr><th class='hold'>Hold</th><th>15'</th><th>30'</th><th>45'</th><th>60'</th><th>75'</th><th>90'</th><th class='point'>Point</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='hold'>FC København</td><td title=\"43 point\">1</td><td title=\"54 point\">1</td><td title=\"55 point\">1</td><td title=\"52 point\">2</td><td title=\"54 point\">1</td><td title=\"63 point\">1</td><td class='point'>63</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'>FC Midtjylland</td><td title=\"37 point\">6</td><td title=\"39 point\">5</td><td title=\"50 point\">2</td><td title=\"52 point\">3</td><td title=\"52 point\">3</td><td title=\"62 point\">2</td><td class='point'>62</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'>Brøndby IF</td><td title=\"41 point\">2</td><td title=\"41 point\">4</td><td title=\"42 point\">4</td><td title=\"46 point\">4</td><td title=\"50 point\">4</td><td title=\"51 point\">3</td><td class='point'>51</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'>Randers FC</td><td title=\"39 point\">4</td><td title=\"39 point\">6</td><td title=\"48 point\">3</td><td title=\"54 point\">1</td><td title=\"54 point\">2</td><td title=\"48 point\">4</td><td class='point'>48</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'>FC Nordsjælland</td><td title=\"39 point\">3</td><td title=\"44 point\">2</td><td title=\"42 point\">5</td><td title=\"42 point\">5</td><td title=\"45 point\">5</td><td title=\"46 point\">5</td><td class='point'>46</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'>AGF</td><td title=\"37 point\">5</td><td title=\"41 point\">3</td><td title=\"41 point\">6</td><td title=\"41 point\">6</td><td title=\"41 point\">6</td><td title=\"40 point\">6</td><td class='point'>40</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'>Silkeborg IF</td><td title=\"44 point\">7</td><td title=\"47 point\">7</td><td title=\"46 point\">7</td><td title=\"51 point\">7</td><td title=\"50 point\">7</td><td title=\"49 point\">7</td><td class='point'>49</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'>Viborg FF</td><td title=\"36 point\">9</td><td title=\"42 point\">8</td><td title=\"44 point\">9</td><td title=\"48 point\">8</td><td title=\"49 point\">8</td><td title=\"47 point\">8</td><td class='point'>47</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'>Sønderjyske</td><td title=\"40 point\">8</td><td title=\"37 point\">9</td><td title=\"44 point\">8</td><td title=\"39 point\">9</td><td title=\"38 point\">9</td><td title=\"37 point\">9</td><td class='point'>37</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'>Vejle BK</td><td title=\"32 point\">11</td><td title=\"32 point\">10</td><td title=\"37 point\">10</td><td title=\"39 point\">10</td><td title=\"33 point\">10</td><td title=\"28 point\">10</td><td class='point'>28</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'>Lyngby BK</td><td title=\"25 point\">12</td><td title=\"28 point\">11</td><td title=\"27 point\">11</td><td title=\"25 point\">12</td><td title=\"29 point\">12</td><td title=\"27 point\">11</td><td class='point'>27</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'>AaB</td><td title=\"33 point\">10</td><td title=\"27 point\">12</td><td title=\"26 point\">12</td><td title=\"33 point\">11</td><td title=\"30 point\">11</td><td title=\"24 point\">12</td><td class='point'>24</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n\n## Comebacks og føringer\n\n::: {.column-margin}\n**Point hentet fra bagud:** point i kampe, hvor holdet på et tidspunkt var bagud. **Point tabt fra føring:** 3 minus point i kampe, hvor holdet på et tidspunkt var foran.\n:::\n\n::: {.column-page-right}\n<picture class=\"graf\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"figurer/2024-25-comebacks-mobil.svg\"><img src=\"figurer/2024-25-comebacks.svg\" alt=\"Point hentet fra bagud og tabt fra føring for hvert hold, Superligaen 2024/25.\" class=\"img-fluid\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture>\n:::\n\n\n## Scoringstidspunkter\n\n::: {.column-margin}\n**Intervaller:** 0–15, 16–30, 31–45+ (inkl. tillægstid i 1. halvleg), 46–60, 61–75 og 76–90+ (inkl. tillægstid). Tal i parentes er mål i alt.\n:::\n\n::: {.column-page-right}\n<picture class=\"graf\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"figurer/2024-25-scoret-mobil.svg\"><img src=\"figurer/2024-25-scoret.svg\" alt=\"Mål scoret pr. 15-minutters interval for hvert hold, Superligaen 2024/25.\" class=\"img-fluid\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture>\n:::\n\n::: {.column-page-right}\n<picture class=\"graf\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"figurer/2024-25-indkasseret-mobil.svg\"><img src=\"figurer/2024-25-indkasseret.svg\" alt=\"Mål indkasseret pr. 15-minutters interval for hvert hold, Superligaen 2024/25.\" class=\"img-fluid\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture>\n:::\n\n\n\n",
